# The photographs and hand cut-outs the division artwork was made from.
#
# THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC and these are the un-abstracted originals: identifiable
# photographs of real players, the hand cut-outs before polymerising, and the GIMP document
# that still holds the players as separate layers. Committing them would publish exactly
# what polyart.js exists to prevent — see the de-identification note in its header.
#
# They live here so the sources sit next to the tools that consume them, not so they ship.
# The polymerised outputs are kept out too: they are already public inside the committed
# social-Division-*.png, but at card resolution, and these are up to 3504px tall.
source/
